                                                "sense_id": "c75f5761-12da-3850-8e67-7d25deaeecc5",
                                                "text": "The militias have already taken the centre of the city. Haganah trucks are visible in the squares, driving Arabs by armed force down to the port."
                                            }
                                        ]
